OL,3,GNEWSAMan who 'repeatedly' approached
OL,4,Aschoolgirl jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who repeatedly approached a
OL,7,F15-year-old girl as she walked home
OL,8,Ffrom school has been jailed for two
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FJamie Fowler, 32, from Locking in North
OL,12,FSomerset, who was banned from making
OL,13,Fcontact with females under the age of
OL,14,F16 as part of his Sexual Harm
OL,15,FPrevention Order (SHPO), made
OL,16,F"inappropriate and sexualised comments"
OL,17,Fabout her appearance in Trowbridge,
OL,18,FWiltshire, on 15 July 2025.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
