OL,3,GNEWSAMan who 'repeatedly' approached
OL,4,Aschoolgirl jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FNatalie Dalton, from Wiltshire Police,
OL,7,Fpraised the bravery of Fowler's victim
OL,8,Fand said the defendant was "fully
OL,9,Faware" of the restrictions on him as
OL,10,Fpart of the order, which has been in
OL,11,Fplace for more than a decade.
OL,13,FFowler admitted breaching the SHPO at
OL,14,FSwindon Crown Court and was sentenced
OL,15,Fon 13 October.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
